add('reseller-staff','POST','/api/reseller/customers','Provision own customer workspace',resellerManagers,'Active selected organization and current owner/admin required. Atomically creates only standard configuration, pinned wholesale-bounded retail version, its trial and a seven-day email-bound owner invitation. Requires at least one allowed owner seat and available shared/customer capacity. Disabled Sales or zero pipeline ceiling skips the default pipeline. No user/membership, external message or provider charge is created. Identical original-actor/request/input retry returns200 same workspace; changed input/actor conflicts. Secrets are excluded from this receipt.',resellerCustomerCreate,resellerCustomer,201);
