add('automation','POST','/api/automation/workflows/{id}/publish','Publish immutable version',admin,'Exactly one trigger, unique nodes, connected acyclic graph. Condition routes unique true/false handles; Switch routes one of1-10 ordered cases or default. At most one outgoing path per handle; other nodes have one path. List settings and safe paths validated. Search validates current workspace object/list/field rules; runtime resolves typed values. GraphQL validates endpoint/document/variables shape and outbound HTTP/GraphQL credentials must belong to this workspace. Endpoint owns GraphQL syntax/schema validation. Reusable workflows must connect every condition/Switch branch to Return values outside Loop item bodies. Calls validate typed mappings, current workspace/active child and exact immutable version, reject self/ancestor references and limit published trees to five levels/1000 calls. Child names/version numbers are server resolved. Optional trigger errorWorkflow pins a current-workspace active Error trigger version; self references and automatic Error trigger handlers are rejected. Activates workflow; future runs use this version.',null,{type:'object',description:'id, workflow_id, version, graph, created_at'});
